# The debug keystore and google-services.json are COMMITTED on purpose so a collaborator can
# clone and run immediately: this repo must stay PRIVATE. The Firebase key is a client
# identifier, not a secret — access is enforced by firestore.rules, and the API key should be
# restricted (package name + SHA-1) in Google Cloud console. Never make this repo public
# without purging these from history first.
